                                                                                               <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/meta/AnnotationVocabulary/usageNote> """Use of this annotation is optional, but recommended if it will help a user understand the intended interpretation(s).
- This annotation should use at most twice with/on a notion.
