                                                                         <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/meta/AnnotationVocabulary/naturalLanguageDefinition> "relation from a disposition to an independent continuant (the bearer), in which the disposition specifically depends on the bearer for its existence"@en-us ;
