                                                                                <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/meta/AnnotationVocabulary/explanatoryNote> "Recognition is preceded by an observation of an entity that is related to the entity being recognized or the entity being recognized is an entity that is an attribute of the entity being observed" ,
