                                                                                <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/meta/AnnotationVocabulary/naturalLanguageDefinition> "relation from an agent to an entity that the agent is able to describe the entity or is able to associate an information content entity that describes the entity, at some time"@en-us .


