                                                                                 <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/meta/AnnotationVocabulary/naturalLanguageDefinition> "relationship from an agent to a process where the agent participates in the process and materially causes the occurrence of the process (plays a causal role)."@en-us ;
                                                                                 <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/meta/AnnotationVocabulary/synonym> "performer in" .


