###  https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/supplychain/SupplyChain/WarehousingPlanSpecification
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/supplychain/SupplyChain/WarehousingPlanSpecification> rdf:type owl:Class ;
